  "prefLabel": "Res 2708.04 Grant Funds Used or Not Used",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 2708.04 Grant Funds Used or Not Used. Within 90 days of the completion date of the training, a grant recipient shall report to the JTP administrator any portions of the dollars allocated for their grant that will not be used.\n\nSource. #8975, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRED: 3-12-08\n\nNew. #9498, eff 7-1-09, EXPIRED: 7-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res2700.html"
